#!/bin/bash

# tam-remove-security-sudoless-docker — take you out of the docker group again.
#
# Ported from Omarchy 4.0.4 (omarchy-remove-security-sudoless-docker) for
# plan 18 R4.15g. Changed: it checks through tam-sudo-docker and reboots
# through tam-system-reboot. It sets no reboot-required flag, because nothing
# reads one any more, and the update migration's deferred-reboot switch is gone.
